WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:01.875
- Ready, here we go.

00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:07.689
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.689 --> 00:00:11.356
My customers aren't interested
in iPhones or iPods.

00:00:11.356 --> 00:00:13.613
They're interested in their memories,

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:17.489
where they were able to
dance and sing to a jukebox.

00:00:17.489 --> 00:00:20.406
It's all about making people happy.

00:00:21.826 --> 00:00:23.653
My name is Perry, and I'm the owner

00:00:23.653 --> 00:00:27.032
of Perry's Jukebox and Pinball
Repair Company in Brooklyn.

00:00:27.032 --> 00:00:29.440
My business is one of the few businesses

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:31.081
in the country that's capable

00:00:31.081 --> 00:00:33.956
of repairing vintage jukeboxes.

00:00:33.956 --> 00:00:35.895
These are called vacuum tubes.

00:00:35.895 --> 00:00:37.642
In most cases, half of them are good,

00:00:37.642 --> 00:00:38.813
half of them are not good.

00:00:38.813 --> 00:00:40.388
Ever since I was a child,

00:00:40.388 --> 00:00:42.841
I was always interested in motors,

00:00:42.841 --> 00:00:45.744
fans and things that moved.

00:00:45.744 --> 00:00:47.602
And looking at a jukebox,

00:00:47.602 --> 00:00:49.487
the arm, the turntable,

00:00:49.487 --> 00:00:51.622
the spinning and the motion

00:00:51.622 --> 00:00:55.510
was something that I
was very intrigued by.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:56.414
(gentle music)

00:00:56.414 --> 00:00:58.392
I do around 20 house calls a month

00:00:58.392 --> 00:01:00.846
to repair jukeboxes.

00:01:00.846 --> 00:01:02.617
I've been asked to go to Ireland,

00:01:02.617 --> 00:01:06.057
Tasmania, Thailand and Scotland.

00:01:06.057 --> 00:01:08.489
To the correct settings.

00:01:08.489 --> 00:01:09.927
Tube is no good.

00:01:09.927 --> 00:01:12.710
Most people that call me,
they love their machines.

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:14.663
They have the records in them

00:01:14.663 --> 00:01:16.530
from when they were teenagers.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:18.549
And it brings back memories.

00:01:18.549 --> 00:01:21.418
And they think that they're
never gonna work again.

00:01:21.418 --> 00:01:24.711
This one's more promising, look at this.

00:01:24.711 --> 00:01:25.822
(light music)

00:01:25.822 --> 00:01:28.040
Being able to restore the machine,

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:31.466
it's something that
really makes me feel good.

00:01:31.466 --> 00:01:34.966
I always leave a house with music playing.

